Indicator: By 2022, survey completed of at least three participating banks&amp;apos; clients to assess the impact of the grant on eligible enterprises&amp;apos; employment and revenues (2019 baseline: not applicable). 
Achievement: 5 
Progress/Status: Achieved. A first survey was conducted for clients from all five PBs: ACB, BIDV, SHB, TPB, and VPB. Out of 301 WSMEs responded, 153 WSMEs reported increase in their sales, accounting for 50.8% of the total respondents. Additionally, total employment increased by 2801, approximately 18 employees per enterprise.
